			{id=21568,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:320784|h[Comet Storm]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:320788|h[Frozen Binds]|h|r will chain its effect to nearby allies when it is removed."},
