		instanceID=1187,
		order=1,
		name="An Affront of Challengers",
		lore="Champions are not fighting just anyone. First contenders fight among themselves to see which are worthy. Dessia the Decapitator, Paceran the Virulant, and Sathel the Accursed have brought their disparate fighting styles together to knock out other contenders. They will crush any who stand between them and the title match.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2391,
