			{id=21746,title="Overview",body="Tred'ova feasts upon the Cocoon of Lakali at 70% and 40% health, triggering |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322450|h[Consumption]|h|r. After feasting Tred'ova becomes more intelligent, increasing the power of several of her abilities."},
			{id=21749,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Move away from allies you are tethered to when affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322648|h[Mind Link]|h|r to reduce party wide damage.\n$bullet;Gormling larva will fixate on players afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322563|h[Marked Prey]|h|r.\n$bullet;Shatter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322527|h[Gorging Shield]|h|r in order to interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322450|h[Consumption]|h|r."},
			{id=21747,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Move away from allies you are tethered to when affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322648|h[Mind Link]|h|r to reduce party wide damage.\n$bullet;Gormling larva will fixate on players afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322563|h[Marked Prey]|h|r.\n$bullet;Shatter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322527|h[Gorging Shield]|h|r in order to interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:322450|h[Consumption]|h|r."},
