	[2406]={
		encounterID=2406,
		instanceID=1185,
		order=1,
		name="Halkias, the Sin-Stained Goliath",
		lore="Sinstones are meant to be inert records of past transgressions. The machinations of the depraved venthyr have allowed Halkias, a massive golem, to grow from the power of neglected sinstones. The Lord Chamberlain's forces have struggled to contain it, splitting its anima across multiple sinstone golem shards.",
