		},
		sections={
			{id=21799,title="Overview",body="Mueh'zala battles players across the realm of De Other Side. Mueh'zala casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:326171|h[Shatter Reality]|h|r, shattering himself into multiple pieces, granting an opportunity for players to release Bwonsamdi's shackles upon defeating Mueh'zala's Shattered Visages. When Mueh'zala begins casting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:326171|h[Shatter Reality]|h|r, Bwonsamdi manifests through the Mojo gathered by players, offering a route to safety through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324698|h[Deathgates]|h|r."},
			{id=21801,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Take Bwonsamdi's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324698|h[Deathgate]|h|r to avoid dying to Mueh'zala's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:326171|h[Shatter Reality]|h|r.\n$bullet; Reduce direct damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327646|h[Soulcrusher]|h|r to reduce damage over time from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327646|h[Crushed Soul]|h|r .\n$bullet; Interact with Mueh'zala's Primeval Grasp totems after defeating Shattered Visage to release |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327891|h[Bwonsamdi's Fury]|h|r."},
			{id=21800,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Take Bwonsamdi's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324698|h[Deathgate]|h|r to avoid dying to Mueh'zala's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:326171|h[Shatter Reality]|h|r.\n$bullet; Interact with Mueh'zala's Primeval Grasp totems after defeating Shattered Visage to release |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327891|h[Bwonsamdi's Fury]|h|r.\n$bullet; Be mindful of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325691|h[Cosmic Collapse]|h|r fields during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325258|h[Master of Death]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327427|h[Shattered Dominion]|h|r."},
			{id=21802,title="Healer",body="$bullet; Take Bwonsamdi's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324698|h[Deathgate]|h|r to avoid dying to Mueh'zala's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:326171|h[Shatter Reality]|h|r.\n$bullet; Dispel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325725|h[Cosmic Artifice]|h|r to reduce both damage over time and party-wide damage.\n$bullet; Be mindful of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325691|h[Cosmic Collapse]|h|r fields during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325258|h[Master of Death]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:327427|h[Shattered Dominion]|h|r."},
			{id=22062,title="Stage 1: The Master of Death",body="Mueh'zala is the god of death, blasting players with blood, shadow, and necromatic magic, twisting reality to his whim."},
			{id=22048,title="Section 5"},
			{id=22049,title="Section 6"},
			{id=22192,title="Section 21"},
