		sections={
			{id=21884,title="Overview",body="Ventunax, the Dark Kyrian Praetor, is honed to such a razor's edge, and moves with such speed, that she leaves |cFF2959D3|Hspell:323927|h[Shadowhirls]|h|r in her wake. Avoid the Dark Bolts emitted from each |cFF2959D3|Hspell:323927|h[Shadowhirl]|h|r when Ventunax makes a move.\n\nWhen depleted of Anima energy, Ventunax takes a moment to recharge, while |cFF2959D3|Hspell:323927|h[Shadowhirls]|h|r continuously erupt."},
			{id=21885,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Regain Ventunax's focus when she strikes at an ally with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324148|h[Dark Stride]|h|r"},
			{id=21887,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:324141|h[Dark Bolts]|h|r from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:323927|h[Shadowhirls]|h|r"},
			{id=21886,title="Healer",body="$bullet;Allies are likely to take high damage when there are many |cFF2959D3|Hspell:323927|h[Shadowhirls]|h|r within the arena"},
