		order=3,
		name="Grand Proctor Beryllia",
		lore="There are only a few old enough to know if Grand Proctor Beryllia learned her ruthless form of study in Revendreth or if she never truly gave up that particular sin. The cruelty she used to master the magic of anima has been turned on a very peculiar new prisoner, the naaru Z'rali. She will command this creature's Light no matter what it costs her prisoner.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2362,
		uiMapID=1676,
