			{itemID=180847,diffs={1,2,23},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=21934,title="Overview",body="$[1, 2Over the course of the encounter Grand Proctor Beryllia passively generates energy. Upon reaching 100 Energy, Grand Proctor Beryllia prepares to unleash a devastating |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r, but the benevolent naaru, Z'rali, will create an area of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325742|h[Shining Radiance]|h|r to help protect all players within it.$]$[8, 23Over the course of the encounter Grand Proctor Beryllia passively generates energy. Upon reaching 100 Energy, Grand Proctor Beryllia prepares to unleash a devastating |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r, but the benevolent naaru, Z'rali, will create several |cFF2959D3|Hspell:328737|h[Fragments of Radiance]|h|r to help protect the players from harm.$]"},
			{id=22515,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Mitigate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r by moving into Z'rali's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325742|h[Shining Radiance]|h|r.\n$bullet;Consider using damage mitigation when Grand Proctor Beryllia casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325254|h[Iron Spikes]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
			{id=21935,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Mitigate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r by collecting Z'rali's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:328737|h[Fragments of Radiance]|h|r.\n$bullet;Consider using damage mitigation when Grand Proctor Beryllia casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325254|h[Iron Spikes]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=22516,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Mitigate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r by moving into Z'rali's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325742|h[Shining Radiance]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
			{id=21936,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Mitigate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r by collecting Z'rali's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:328737|h[Fragments of Radiance]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=22517,title="Healer",body="$bullet; Mitigate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325360|h[Rite of Supremacy]|h|r by moving into Z'rali's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:325742|h[Shining Radiance]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
