		sections={
			{id=22449,title="Overview",body="Mortanis begins the battle once all of his necromancers are defeated, transforming into a powerful creature of bone. His Spine Crawl deals heavy damage to enemies in a line, while Unruly Remains burst three times in ever-increasing circular areas. Several of his attacks split damage between affected players, including Screaming Skull and Bone Cleave. When weakened, he will cast Lord of the Fallen, allowing him to rapidly cast area damage spells for the duration."},
			{id=22450,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Dodge |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338848|h[Spine Crawl]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move away from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338849|h[Unruly Remains]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up with allies when afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338851|h[Screaming Skull]|h|r.\n$bullet;When possible, remove |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338847|h[Unholy Frenzy]|h|r."},
			{id=22451,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Dodge |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338848|h[Spine Crawl]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move away from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338849|h[Unruly Remains]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up with allies when afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338851|h[Screaming Skull]|h|r.\n$bullet;Stand together with other tanks to share the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338846|h[Bone Cleave]|h|r."},
			{id=22452,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Dodge |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338848|h[Spine Crawl]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move away from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338849|h[Unruly Remains]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up with allies when afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:338851|h[Screaming Skull]|h|r."},
