			{itemID=186534,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=190652,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=22929,title="Overview",body="The P.O.S.T. Master pummels players with everything at its disposal, from crushingly heavy |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346967|h[Money Order]|h|rs to unidentified |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346286|h[Hazardous Liquids]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, the P.O.S.T. Master activates the central mail portal, releasing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346947|h[Unstable Goods]|h|r. Players must quickly deposit these into an active Delivery Portal to avoid an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346297|h[Unstable Explosion]|h|r."},
			{id=22930,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Throw |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346947|h[Unstable Goods]|h|r into an active Delivery Portal before they trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346297|h[Unstable Explosion]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346967|h[Money Order]|h|r, as its damage is shared among all players hit."},
			{id=22931,title="Healer",body="$bullet;Throw |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346947|h[Unstable Goods]|h|r into an active Delivery Portal before they trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346297|h[Unstable Explosion]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346967|h[Money Order]|h|r, as its damage is shared among all players hit.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:346742|h[Fan Mail]|h|r inflicts significant damage to all players."},
			{id=22932,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Throw |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346947|h[Unstable Goods]|h|r into an active Delivery Portal before they trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346297|h[Unstable Explosion]|h|r.\n$bullet;Group up for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:346967|h[Money Order]|h|r, as its damage is shared among all players hit."},
