		sections={
			{id=23092,title="Overview",body="Each player selects an instrument to play, and must try to hit their notes as waves of belligerent patrons periodically rush the stage.\n\nWhen enough patrons have been defeated, Zo'gron himself steps in to put an end to the performance."},
			{id=23093,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Hitting notes with instruments makes you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:348567|h[Jazzy]|h|r, increasing your haste. A flawless performance grants you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:358311|h[Up Tempo!]|h|r\n$bullet;Oasis Security staff inflict heavy damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:350916|h[Security Slam]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:350922|h[Menacing Shout]|h|r.\n$bullet;Zo'gron inflicts additional damage when players are in close proximity to each other with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:355438|h[Suppression Spark]|h|r."},
			{id=23094,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Hitting notes with instruments makes you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:348567|h[Jazzy]|h|r, increasing your haste. A flawless performance grants you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:358311|h[Up Tempo!]|h|r\n$bullet;Oasis patrons will become |cFF2959D3|Hspell:353706|h[Rowdy]|h|r if not defeated quicly.\n$bullet;Zo'gron inflicts additional damage when players are in close proximity to each other with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:355438|h[Suppression Spark]|h|r."},
			{id=23095,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Hitting notes with instruments makes you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:348567|h[Jazzy]|h|r, increasing your haste. A flawless performance grants you |cFF2959D3|Hspell:358311|h[Up Tempo!]|h|r\n$bullet;Oasis Security staff inflict heavy damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:350916|h[Security Slam]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:350922|h[Menacing Shout]|h|r.\n$bullet;Zo'gron inflicts additional damage when players are in close proximity to each other with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:355438|h[Suppression Spark]|h|r."},
