			{itemID=182126,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=183479,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=23871,title="Overview",body="The Vigilant Guardian will activate Pre-Fabricated Sentries to attack players periodically while employing its own defense routines. Throughout the encounter the Vigilant Guardian will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Expose]|h|r its core, inflicting lethal damage to all players not shielded by an Automated Defense Matrix.\n\nWhen automa are defeated, their energy is automatically redistributed to the next largest |cFF2959D3|Hspell:363447|h[Powered Down]|h|r automa.  Automa restored to full power in this way reactivate."},
			{id=23872,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;The Vigilant Custodian and the Pre-Fabricated Sentries use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:364447|h[Dissonance]|h|r to inflict very high damage to their current target.\n$bullet;The Vigilant Guardian can only be damaged by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonation]|h|r of an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r dropped by Automated Defense Matrixes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:360404|h[Force Field]|h|r greatly reduces the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Exposed Core]|h|r."},
			{id=23874,title="Healers",body="$bullet;The Vigilant Guardian can only be damaged by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonation]|h|r of an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r dropped by Automated Defense Matrixes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:360404|h[Force Field]|h|r greatly reduces the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Exposed Core]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=24580,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;The Vigilant Guardian can only be damaged by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonation]|h|r of an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r dropped by Automated Defense Matrixes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:360404|h[Force Field]|h|r greatly reduces the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Exposed Core]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=24579,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:359608|h[Deresolution]|h|r will trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360202|h[Spikes of Creation]|h|r caught in its path.\n$bullet;The Vigilant Guardian can only be damaged by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonation]|h|r of an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r dropped by Automated Defense Matrixes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:360404|h[Force Field]|h|r greatly reduces the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Exposed Core]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=23873,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:359608|h[Deresolution]|h|r will trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360202|h[Spikes of Creation]|h|r caught in its path.\n$bullet;The Vigilant Guardian can only be damaged by the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonation]|h|r of an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r dropped by Automated Defense Matrixes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:360404|h[Force Field]|h|r greatly reduces the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360412|h[Exposed Core]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=24374,title="Automa",body="The Vigilant Guardian is aided by various automa.  Automa are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:363447|h[Powered Down]|h|r until restored to full power.  When Automa are defeated their power is redistributed to the next largest automa nearby that is still |cFF2959D3|Hspell:363447|h[Powered Down]|h|r."},
			{id=24375,title="Section 31"},
			{id=24357,title="Automated Defense Matrix",body="The Automated Defense Matrix creates a Force Field when powered up.\n\nDrops Unstable Cores on death."},
			{id=23996,title="Section 14"},
			{id=24581,title="Section 33",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=24602,title="Section 38",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=23992,title="Section 10"},
			{id=23993,title="Section 11"},
			{id=24365,title="Point Defense Drone",body="Targets enemies at random with its Blast ability once powered up."},
			{id=24366,title="Section 23"},
			{id=24659,title="Section 40"},
			{id=24578,title="Section 29"},
			{id=24361,title="Pre-Fabricated Sentry",body="The Vigilant Guardian periodically awakens Pre-Fabricated Sentries to assist itself."},
			{id=24362,title="Section 19"},
			{id=24363,title="Section 20"},
			{id=24358,title="Volatile Materium",body="The Vigilant Guardian periodically awakens Volatile Materium to assist itself."},
			{id=24582,title="Section 32"},
			{id=23875,title="Stage One: Systems Online!",body="The Vigilant Guardian begins the encounter protected by the gateway to the Sepulcher of the First Ones.  |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360528|h[Detonating]|h|r an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360458|h[Unstable Core]|h|r nearby will damage the Vigilant Guardian.\n$[!16\n\nOn Mythic Raid Difficulty, the Vigilant Guardian rolls out of the wall, using their Stage Two abilities during Stage One.$]"},
			{id=23995,title="Section 13"},
			{id=24600,title="Section 36",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=24601,title="Section 37",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=24647,title="Section 39"},
			{id=24369,title="Spell Name",body="$[!16\n\nOn Mythic Raid Difficulty, a Spike of Creation is created with the impact of Refracted Blast.$]"},
			{id=24566,title="Section 28",body="$[!16\n\nSpikes of Creation are also triggered by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:359608|h[Deresolution]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:360162|h[Split Resolution]|h|r.$]",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=23994,title="Section 12"},
			{id=23877,title="Stage Two: Roll Out, then Transform",body="Once the Vigilant Guardian reaches 40% health remaining it rolls forward and then transforms into its battle mode."},
			{id=23876,title="Spell Name"},
			{id=24373,title="Section 29"},
			{id=24583,title="Section 34"},
			{id=24371,title="Section 27"},
			{id=24372,title="Section 28"},
			{id=24584,title="Section 35"},
			{id=24376,title="Stage Three: Self-Destruct Sequence",body="At 15% health remaining, the Vigilant Guardian activates its self-destruct sequence."},
			{id=24377,title="Section 33"},
		},
	},
